      "rationale": "The span explicitly states the threshold requirement and its timing."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C059.signal_basis",
    "value": "Repeated booking observations identify a stage whose delays recur on multiple days in each investigation week and account for the greatest documented delay burden in both weeks.",
    "scope": "A provisional trial-selection signal, subject to adequate bookings and a ranking robust to missing records; it supplies neither statistical proof nor causal identification.",
